    "title": "John Cleese warns Britain will cease to exist if Christian values give way to Islamic ones - Whatfinger News Quick Hits",
    "text": "John Cleese, the legendary comic actor behind Monty Python’s Flying Circus, posted a blunt warning on X this Monday: Britain will cease to be Britain if its Christian values are supplanted by Islamic ones.\n“The UK has always been based at the deepest level on Christian values, regardless of dogma,” Cleese wrote. As reported by Breitbart News, he acknowledged the institutional church’s imperfections but argued that “for centuries British people have been influenced by Christ’s teaching.”\nRead Full Article: https://conservativeinstitute.org/politics/john-cleese-warns-britain-will-cease-to-exist-if-christian-values-give-way-to-islamic-ones.htm",
    "summary": "John Cleese, the legendary comic actor behind Monty Python’s Flying Circus, posted a blunt warning on X this Monday: Britain will cease to be Britain if its Christian values are supplanted by Islamic ones. “The UK has always been based at the deepest level on Christian values, regardless of dogma,” Cleese wrote. As reported by Breitbart News, he acknowledged the institutional church’s imperfections but argued that “for centuries British people have been influenced by Christ’s teaching.”",
